## What exists today

| Piece | Status |
| --- | --- |
| `Normal<B, SE3>`, `Normal<B, EuclideanD>` with residual, location, whitening and Fisher-root bindings | built |
| SE(3) compose, inverse, rotate and unrotate operations | built |
| `residual_layout`, `tangent_layout`, `jacobian_vjp`, `require_role` | built |
| `linearize`, block-sparse elimination (COLAMD, junction tree, multifrontal QR), `retract_flat` | built |
| Residuals in the same row order as $J$ (`residual_blocks`, `residual_vector`) | built |
| An `Estimator` (damping schedule, line search, convergence test) | missing |

